t, Basic Amenities, Fire Alarm, Fire Rated Doors, Security Cabin, Seating Area, Vitrified Tile Flooring, 24/7 Electricity Backup, Smart Lighting, Fire Fighting System, Car Parking, Lift, Sit Out Area, Service Lift , Double Height Living Room, Branded Fittings & Fixtures, False Ceiling With Led Lighting, Anti Skid Flooring In Bathrooms.\n\nThe price of apartments in this project starts at ₹65.05 Cr per sq.ft, offering great value in the real estate market.\n\nLodha Malabar is located at\n\nLodha Malabar offers Fire Safety System, Security, Clubhouse, Security Guards, 24 7 Water Supply, 24x7 Security, Cctv Surveillance, Dg Backup, Lounge Area, Deck, Cab Pickup And Dropoff Point, Balcony, Designer Bathroom Tiles, Glass Partitions In Bathrooms, Maid Helper Room, Cab Pickup Point, Basic Amenities, Fire Alarm, Fire Rated Doors, Security Cabin, Seating Area, Vitrified Tile Flooring, 24/7 Electricity Backup, Smart Lighting, Fire Fighting System, Car Parking, Lift, Sit Out Area, Service Lift , Double Height Living Room, Branded Fittings & Fixtures, False Ceiling With Led Lighting, Anti Skid Flooring In Bathrooms for a comfortable lifestyle.\n\nThe carpet area for available units ranges from 3826 sq.ft to 6640.25 sq.ft\n\n![sparkle](/sparkle-icon.svg)\n\nNOBO AI\n\nAI Assistant is Online\n\n# Need Help Finding the Right Property?\n\nChat with our AI assistant for instant answers on West Pune properties—pricing, locations, amenities, and availability. Available 24/7 to guide you at every step.\n\n## Are you Interested inLodha Malabar?\n\nLodha Malabar, Malabar hill, Mumbai | NoBrokerage.com","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/maharera-project/lodha-malabar/P51900034949","title":"Lodha Malabar, Walkeshwar Mumbai — Price, Possession & RERA | MPE","raw_content":"[![Mumbai Property Exchange](/static/images/logo.png)](/)\n[List Property](/list-property)[WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919820067525)\n\n[New Projects](/projects-new-homes)[🗺️ Projects Map](/projects-map)[Buy a Flat](/apartments-flats-house/sale/all-locations)[Rent a Flat](/apartments-flats-house/rent/all-locations)[Commercial](/commercial-office-premises/sale/all-locations)[Builders & Developers](/builders)[Why Us](/why-us)[RERA Search](/rera-search)[Localities](/locations)[Tools & Calculators](/tools/budget-planner)[NRI Hub](/nri-hub)[News](/news)[+ List Your Property](/list-property)[💬 WhatsApp Us](https://wa.me/919820067525)\n\nMumbai property advisory & dataOperating since 1995✓ MahaRERA A51800043517Source-labelled project dataWe reply in minutes on WhatsApp\n\n![Lodha Malabar](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/29033/29033-main.webp)✓ MahaRERA P51900034949RERA: no litigation reported\n\n# Lodha Malabar\n\nby [Lodha Developers](/builder/lodha-developers-limited)\n\n📍 Walkeshwar Mumbai, Mumbai City · 400006\n\nCertificate Signed\n\n**Lifecycle requires verification**\n\nAsk an advisor to verify the current project and inventory status.\n\nSource stage: New · mapped resale: 0 · mapped rental: 0 · primary status: recorded\n\ni\n\n## Overview\n\n\\*\\*Lodha Malabar Walkeshwar: The Epitome of Luxury Living in South Mumbai\\*\\*\n\nLodha Malabar, located in the prestigious Walkeshwar area of South Mumbai, redefines opulent living. This iconic residential development combines contemporary architecture with timeless elegance, offering discerning homeowners an address synonymous with luxury and exclusivity.\n\n### \\*\\*Prime Location\\*\\*\n\nSituated at Walkeshwar, one of Mumbai's most sought-after locales, Lodha Malabar boasts stunning views of the Arabian Sea and easy access to key landmarks like Marine Drive, the Hanging Gardens, and the Jain Temples. Its proximity to South Mumbai's business districts and cultural hubs makes it an ideal choice for high-profile professionals and families alike.\n\n### \\*\\*Exquisite Residences\\*\\*\n\nEach residence at Lodha Malabar is meticulously crafted to provide unparalleled comfort and style. Spacious layouts, high ceilings, and floor-to-ceiling windows invite natural light while offering breathtaking views of the city skyline and the ocean. Premium fittings, imported marble flooring, and thoughtfully designed interiors reflect a seamless blend of luxury and functionality.\n\n### \\*\\*World-Class Amenities\\*\\*\n\nResidents can indulge in a host of world-class amenities, including:\n\n- A state-of-the-art fitness center\n\n- Infinity-edge swimming pool with panoramic sea views\n\n- Lavish clubhouse for social gatherings\n\n- Landscaped gardens for tranquil evenings\n\n- Concierge services to cater to every need\n\n### \\*\\*Secure and Private\\*\\*\n\nThe development prioritizes safety and exclusivity, offering 24/7 security, video surveillance, and private elevators to ensure complete peace of mind.\n\n### \\*\\*A Legacy Address\\*\\*\n\nOwning a home at Lodha Malabar is not just about living in luxury; it’s about being part of a legacy. Walkeshwar’s rich history and Lodha’s renowned reputation in real estate make this property an investment in both lifestyle and heritage.\n\nExperience the pinnacle of urban sophistication and serene living at Lodha Malabar Walkeshwar, where every detail is designed to exceed expectations.\n\n₹\n\n## Price vs Locality\n\n₹24,232\n\n/sqft · locality avg **₹120,000**\n\n80% below avg\n\n₹\n\n## Walkeshwar — resale, rent & yield\n\nResale\n\n₹71,969/sqft\n\nmedian · 19 listings\n\nRent\n\n₹195.2/sqft/mo\n\n2 BHK ~₹210,000/mo\n\nGross yield\n\n3.3%/yr\n\nrent vs resale value\n\nFrom MPE live listings, last 18 months · [Mumbai price index ›](/mumbai-property-price-index)\n\n01\n\n## Possession Timeline\n\nProposed\n\nJun 2026\n\nStatus\n\nNew\n\n02\n\n## Unit Configurations (per MahaRERA)\n\nConfigurationCarpetIndicative Price\n\n4 BHK3,607–4,054 ft²₹8.74 Cr–₹9.82 Cr\n\n5 BHK And More7,668–7,923 ft²₹18.58 Cr–₹19.2 Cr\n\n5 BHK Amp Amp7,995–18,230 ft²₹19.37 Cr–₹44.17 Cr\n\nConfigurations & carpet per MahaRERA filing · indicative price =