udio are in the range of 263 - 464 sqft. The area of 1 BHK are in the range of 523 - 931 sqft. The area of 2 BHK are in the range of 704 - 1187 sqft. The area of 3 BHK are in the range of 1278 - 1987 sqft. The area of 4 BHK are in the range of 1681 - 5051 sqft. The area of 5 BHK are in the range of 2517 - 5482 sqft. A Studio Apartment is available at a starting price of Rs 3.4 Crs. A 1 BHK Apartment is available at a starting price of Rs 6.8 Crs. A 2 BHK Apartment is available at a starting price of Rs 9.2 Crs. A 3 BHK Apartment is available at a starting price of Rs 16.7 Crs. A 4 BHK Apartment is available at a starting price of Rs 22 Crs. A 5 BHK Apartment is available at a starting price of Rs 33 Crs.\n\nThe prime location of Lodha Malabar is a significant advantage for prospective homebuyers, as it is positioned in one of Mumbai's most desirable neighbourhoods. Malabar Hill, an already well-developed area, provides excellent connectivity to the rest of the city. The project enjoys close proximity to major roads, railway stations, metro stations, and bus stations, resulting in reduced commuting time for office-goers. Additionally, the neighbourhood offers abundant options for retail shopping and fulfilling daily needs.\n\nOverall, Lodha Malabar is an exceptional residential project that ensures a comfortable living experience for its residents through its top-notch amenities and outstanding location.\n\n---\n\n##### More info about Lodha Malabar\n\n* About Lodha Group\n\nLodha Group is known for its commitment to sustainability, and this is reflected in the design of Lodha Crown. They are a leading real estate developer in India. Founded in 1980, the company has completed over 55 million square feet of real estate projects and has a development portfolio of over 43 million square feet. The company has a presence in Mumbai, Pune, Hyderabad, and London. Lodha Group is known for its luxurious and innovative residential and commercial properties. Lodha Group has won several awards for its projects, including the CNBC Awaaz Real Estate Award and the ET Best Realty Brands Award.\n\n![about](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/64367e9923fd8d19d1de84ec/a6ec514b-7f87-43dc-bb75-937034eabca2_ELOVATION.jpg)\n\n---\n\n##### Properties\n\n* Nearby Properties\n* More properties by Lodha Group\n\n[![Satellite Viceroy-IndexTap](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/6461d94919f52057681f4546/23d6fa3b-793f-47b8-bb98-4ea336e19a2e_Elevation.png)\n\n#### Satellite Viceroy\n\nMumbai Central, Mumbai\n\n1, 2 & 3 BHK Flats\n\n1.2 Cr-2.0 Cr](/properties/details/satellite-group/mumbai-central/satellite-viceroy/6461d94919f52057681f4546)\n\n[![Rohan Lifescapes Arihant-IndexTap](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/6421425923fd8d19d1de804e/4b3ee982-50c8-4b13-9bb0-54020674e8f0_Screenshot2023-05-19170227.png)\n\n#### Rohan Lifescapes Arihant\n\nGirgaon, Mumbai\n\n1, 2, 3 & 4 BHK Flats\n\n90 L-3.5 Cr](/properties/details/rohan-lifescapes/girgaon/rohan-lifescapes-arihant/6421425923fd8d19d1de804e)\n\n[![Shelaji Avenues-IndexTap](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/64088c932a441574ebe9799e/8648b2dd-dd76-4db3-b740-c9892bf2f356_Screenshot2023-05-19170631.png)\n\n#### Shelaji Avenues\n\nMumbai Central, Mumbai\n\n1 BHK Flats\n\n62 L-62 L](/properties/details/shelaji-group/mumbai-central/shelaji-avenues/64088c932a441574ebe9799e)\n\n[![Rohan Lifescapes Shubham-IndexTap](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/6401dd012a441574ebe978cc/c8fe87e6-7405-472b-b359-bdabf9f5976c_Screenshot2023-05-19170336.png)\n\n#### Rohan Lifescapes Shubham\n\nGirgaon, Mumbai\n\n2 & 3 BHK Flats\n\n2.5 Cr-3.5 Cr](/properties/details/rohan-lifescapes/girgaon/rohan-lifescapes-shubham/6401dd012a441574ebe978cc)\n\n[![Rohan Lifescapes Siddhant-IndexTap](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/63ff55a42a441574ebe97839/240b9a46-0221-49ef-9779-79dd86fbe761_elevation.pn