ar-Hill), Mumbai.\n\n##\n\nThe developer of Lodha Malabar is [Lodha Group](https://www.indextap.com/property-for-sale/Mumbai/Lodha-Group).\n\n##\n\nThere are 3 towers/wings in Lodha Malabar.\n\n##\n\nThe other projects by this developer are , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , .\n\n##\n\nDifferent configurations available in Lodha Malabar are Studio, 1, 2, 3, 4 & 5 BHK.\n\n##\n\nThe area of Studio in Lodha Malabar are in the range of 263 - 464 sqft.\n\n##\n\nThe area of 1 BHK in Lodha Malabar are in the range of 523 - 931 sqft.\n\n##\n\nThe area of 2 BHK in Lodha Malabar are in the range of 704 - 1187 sqft.\n\n##\n\nThe area of 3 BHK in Lodha Malabar are in the range of 1278 - 1987 sqft.\n\n##\n\nThe area of 4 BHK in Lodha Malabar are in the range of 1681 - 5051 sqft.\n\n##\n\nThe price of 4 BHK in Lodha Malabar is in the range of Rs 38,10,00,000 - 71,22,03,000.\n\n##\n\nThe area of 5 BHK in Lodha Malabar are in the range of 2517 - 5482 sqft.\n\n---\n\n#### Area Calculator (Converter)\n\nA land area calculator is a useful tool for converting one unit to another. Land measurements vary across India. If you want to find the equivalent unit of the local term for the unit, the simplest method is to use a land calculator.\n\n* [Square Feet to Gaj Converter](/site/sqft-to-gaj-converter)\n* [Millimeters to Feet Converter](/site/millimeters-to-feet-converter)\n* [CM to Inches Converter](/site/cm-to-inches-converter)\n* [Cent to Square Feet Converter](/site/cent-to-square-feet-converter)\n* [Meter to Centimeter Converter](/site/meter-to-centimeter-converter)\n* [Feet to Centimeter Converter](/site/feet-to-cm-converter)\n* [CM to Feet Converter](/site/cm-to-feet-converter)\n* [MM to Inches Converter](/site/mm-to-inches-converter)\n* [Inches to CM Converter](/site/inches-to-cm-converter)\n* [Inches to Feet Conver