y, 2 properties are listed for sale by owners and dealers, providing multiple options to explore. Kalpataru Prive, Runwal Malabar, Dhuleva Seven, Aurum Girnar, Birla Anayu are key nearby under-construction projects. HM Central Park, Satellite Sesen, Mesacon The South Bay, Arkade Rise, Orbit Shivam are among the nearby societies that are ready for possession.\n\n### How is the Malabar Hill Real Estate Market?\n\n During the July 2026 quarter, the average pricing for multistorey apartments in Malabar Hill is noted at Rs. 80,936/sq. ft, and the price range spans from Rs. 57,180 to Rs. 1 lakhs/sq. ft, covering diverse budget preferences. Currently, residential rental yields in Malabar Hill, Mumbai is approx 2.96%. Going by 57 reviews shared by residents, Malabar Hill maintains a rating of 4.41/5.Gopi Birla Memorial School and The Cathedral & John Connon Infant School are notable schools conveniently located within walking reach of the project.\n\nProject Summary is Ai Generated\n\nKey Highlights\n\nAmenities\n\nPower Back Up\n\nSecurity\n\nPark\n\nSewage treatment plant\n\nAesthetically designed landscape garden\n\nWaste water recycling\n\nFire Fighting Equipment\n\n## Ratings & Reviews\n\n for Malabar Hill\n\nLocality\n\n4.4\n\nAverage Rating\n\n(57 Total Reviews)\n\nOverall Rating\n\n5\n\n4\n\n3\n\n2\n\n1\n\nEnvironment\n\n4.6/5\n\nNeighbourhood\n\nRoads\n\nSafety\n\nCleanliness\n\nCommuting\n\n4.4/5\n\nPublic Transport\n\nParking\n\nConnectivity\n\nTraffic\n\nPlaces of Interest\n\n4.2/5\n\nSchools\n\nHospitals\n\nRestaurants\n\nMarkets\n\nLocality Reviews\n\nG\n\nGuest User\n\nOwner\n\n17/02/2026\n\nA Peaceful Spiritual Oasis Malabar Hill is unique\n\nA Peaceful Spiritual Oasis Malabar Hill is unique because we have the Banganga Tank nearby. The spir... Show More\n\nG\n\nGuest User\n\nOwner\n\n13/02/2026\n\nMorning Walks Amidst Greenery I start my days\n\nMorning Walks Amidst Greenery I start my days jogging through the Hanging Gardens. Living in Malabar... Show More