ts-New-Delhi)\n*   [New Projects in Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/new-projects-Mumbai)\n*   [New Projects in Chennai](https://www.magicbricks.com/new-projects-Chennai)\n*   [New Projects in Pune](https://www.magicbricks.com/new-projects-Pune)\n*   [New Projects in Noida](https://www.magicbricks.com/new-projects-Noida)\n*   [New Projects in Gurgaon](https://www.magicbricks.com/new-projects-Gurgaon)\n*   [New Projects in Bangalore](https://www.magicbricks.com/new-projects-Bangalore)\n*   [New Projects in Ahmedabad](https://www.magicbricks.com/new-projects-Ahmedabad)\n*   [MagicHomes](https://www.magicbricks.com/magichomes)\n\nProperty Services\n\n*   [Home Loan](https://www.magicbricks.com/homeloan/home?inc=homeloan_footer_property_services_home_loan_link)\n*   [Home Interior](https://www.magicbricks.com/home-interior/)\n\n*   [Sitemap](https://www.magicbricks.com/sitemap.html)\n*   [Terms & Conditions](https://property.magicbricks.com/terms/terms.html)\n*   [Privacy Policy](https://property.magicbricks.com/terms/privacy-policy.html)\n*   [Whistle Blower Policy](https://property.magicbricks.com/terms/whistle-blower-policy.html)\n*   [Blog](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/)\n*   [Careers](https://www.magicbricks.com/careers)\n*   [Testimonials](https://property.magicbricks.com/testimonials/testimonials.htm)\n*   [Unsubscribe](https://www.magicbricks.com/mbutility/unSubEmail)\n*   [Help Center](https://www.magicbricks.com/help/)\n*   [Sales Enquiry](https://www.magicbricks.com/contactUs)\n*   [Buy Services](https://www.magicbricks.com/advertise-with-us)\n*   [News](https://www.magicbricks.com/news/)\n\nDisclaimer: Magicbricks Realty Services Limited is only an intermediary offering its platform to advertise properties of Seller for a Customer/Buyer/User coming on its Website and is not and cannot be a party to or privy to or control in any manner any transactions between the Seller and the Customer/Buyer/User. All the offers and discounts on this Website have been extended by Read more various Builder(s)/Developer(s) who have advertised their products. Magicbricks is only communicating the offers and not selling or rendering any of those products or services. It neither warrants nor is it making any representations with respect to offer(s) made on the site. Magicbricks Realty Services Limited shall neither be responsible nor liable to mediate or resolve any disputes or disagreements between the Customer/Buyer/User and the Seller and both Seller and Customer/Buyer/User shall settle all such disputes without involving Magicbricks Realty Services Limited in any manner.\n\nAll trademarks, logos and names are properties of their respective owners. All Rights Reserved. © Copyright 2026 Magicbricks Realty Services Limited.","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/lodha-malabar/208302/project","title":"Lodha Malabar, Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Price on Request","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![Lodha developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/lodha-521-6366.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Lodha Malabar Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nPositioned on the iconic Walkeshwar Road, Lodha Malabar introduces a limited collection of ultra-luxury residences overlooking both the Arabian Sea and the Hanging Gardens. Inspired by Mumbai's celebrated Art Deco heritage, the development combines timeless architecture with expansive sea-facing homes, curated hospitality, and one of South Mumbai's most distinguished residential addresses. Located at Malabar Hill Mumbai, the development enjoys uninterrupted sea and garden views while offering residents access to Gymnasium, Swimming Pool, Power Backup, Treated Water Supply, 24 x 7 Security, CCTV / Video Surveillance, Party Hall, Clubhouse, Rain Water Harvesting, Sewage Treatment Plant, including the exclusive Club Saint Amand and personalised hospitality services. The project is registered under RERA No. P51900034949, P51900055626.\n\nPositioned on the iconic Walkeshwar Road, Lodha Malabar introduces a limited collection of ultra-luxury residences overlooking both the Arabian Sea and the Hanging Gardens. Inspired by Mumbai's celebrated Art Deco heritage, the development combines timeless architecture with expansive sea-facing homes, curated hospitality, and one of South Mumbai's most distinguished residential addresses. Located at Malabar Hill Mumbai, the development enjoys uninterrupted sea and garden views while offering residents access to Gymnasium, Swimming Pool, Power Backup, Treated Water Supply, 24 x 7 Security, CCTV / Video Surveillance, Party Hall, Clubhouse, Rain Water Harvesting, Sewage Treatment Plant, including the exclusive Club Saint Amand and personalised hospitality services. The project is registered under RERA No. P51900034949, P51900055626.\n\n![Lodha Malabar Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lodha-malabar-project-project-large-image1-3945.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![Lodha Malabar Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lodha-malabar-project-amenities-features1-4819.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Lodha Malabar Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lodha-malabar-project-amenities-features4-6188.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Lodha Malabar Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-malabar-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**Price on Request**\n\n## Why you should consider Lodha Malabar?\n\n## About Lodha Malabar, Malabar Hill by Lodha\n\nCertain addresses become landmarks because of their location, while a select few earn recognition through the experience they create. Lodha Malabar belongs to the latter category. Rising on one of the largest land parcels in Malabar Hill, the development has been conceived as an Art Deco-inspired residential landmark that celebrates South Mumbai's architectural legacy while introducing contemporary luxury living. Situated at Malabar Hill Mumbai, opposite the Governor's Estate and overlooking both the Arabian Sea and the Hanging Gardens, the project offers a setting that is rarely available in Mumbai's luxury residential market. Every residence has been planned to capture panoramic views of the sea and surrounding greenery, allowing the location itself to become an integral part of everyday living.\n\nThe architectural language pays tribute to Mumbai's historic Art Deco movement through elegant proportions, intricate detailing, and enduring craftsmanship. Complementing the residences is Club Saint Amand, an exclusive private members' club designed around wellness, leisure, hospitality, and social experiences. Residents also benefit from personalized services delivered by Lodha's in-house hospitality team, bringing the attentiveness of a luxury hotel into a private residential setting. The project is registered under RERA No. P51900034949, P51900055626, further reinforcing transparency for prospective homebuyers.\n\n### Key USPs of Lodha Malabar\n\nLodha Malabar has been envisioned as more than a premium residential tower. It combines heritage-inspired architecture, an irreplaceable location, curated hospitality, and limited-edition residences to create one of South Mumbai's most exclusive addresses.\n\n#### 1. Landmark Address in Malabar Hill\n\nLocated on Walkeshwar Road, opposite the Governor's Estate and overlooking both the Arabian Sea and the Hanging Gardens, the project occupies one of South Mumbai's most prestigious residential locations.\n\n#### 2. Contemporary Interpretation of Art Deco Architecture\n\nThe development draws inspiration from Mumbai's iconic Art Deco heritage, incorporating refined geometry, intricate detailing, and premium craftsmanship to create an architectural identity that is both timeless and contemporary.\n\n#### 3. Club Saint Amand\n\nResidents enjoy access to Club Saint Amand, an exclusive private members' club planned around wellness, recreation, leisure, and social experiences, creating a lifestyle beyond the residence itself.\n\n#### 4. Luxury Hospitality Services\n\nDedicated hospitality professionals provide personalized residential services inspired by five-star hotels, delivering a seamless living experience with discreet and attentive service.\n\n#### 5. Limited Collection of Sea-Facing Residences\n\nSet on one of the largest land parcels in Malabar Hill, Lodha Malabar offers expansive residences with uninterrupted views of the Arabian Sea and surrounding greenery, creating a level of exclusivity that is increasingly rare in South Mumbai\n\nCertain addresses become landmarks because of their location, while a select few earn recognition through the experience they create. Lodha Malabar belongs to the latter category. Rising on one of the largest land parcels in Malabar Hill, the development has been conceived as an Art Deco-inspired residential landmark that celebrates South Mumbai's architectural legacy while introducing contemporary luxury living. Situated at Malabar Hill Mumbai, opposite the Governor's Estate and overlooking both the Arabian Sea and the Hanging Gardens, the project offers a setting that is rarely available in Mumbai's luxury residential market. Every residence has been planned to capture panoramic views of the sea and surrounding greenery, allowing the location itself to become an integral part of everyday living.\n\nThe architectural language pays tribute to Mumbai's historic Art Deco movement through elegant proportions, intricate detailing, and enduring craftsmanship. Complementing the residences is Club Saint Amand, an exclusive private members' club designed around wellness, leisure, hospitality, and social experiences. Residents also benefit from personalized services delivered by Lodha's in-house hospitality team, bringing the attentiveness of a luxury hotel into a private residential setting. The project is registered under RERA No. P51900034949, P51900055626, further reinforcing transparency for prospective homebuyers.\n\n### Key USPs of Lodha Malabar\n\nLodha Malabar has been envisioned as more than a premium residential tower. It combines heritage-inspired architecture, an irreplaceable location, curated hospitality, and limited-edition residences to create one of South Mumbai's most exclusive addresses.\n\n#### 1. Landmark Address in Malabar Hill\n\nLocated on Walkeshwar Road, opposite the Governor's Estate and overlooking both the Arabian Sea and the Hanging Gardens, the project occupies one of South Mumbai's most prestigious residential locations.\n\n#### 2. Contemporary Interpretation of Art Deco Architecture\n\nThe development draws inspiration from Mumbai's iconic Art Deco heritage, incorporating refined geometry, intricate detailing, and premium craftsmanship to create an architectural identity that is both timeless and contemporary.\n\n#### 3. Club Saint Amand\n\nResidents enjoy access to Club Saint Amand, an exclusive private members' club planned around wellness, recreation, leisure, and social experiences, creating a lifestyle beyond the residence itself.\n\n#### 4. Luxury Hospitality Services\n\nDedicated hospitality professionals provide personalized residential services inspired by five-star hotels, delivering a seamless living experience with discreet and attentive service.\n\n#### 5. Limited Collection of Sea-Facing Residences\n\nSet on one of the largest land parcels in Malabar Hill, Lodha Malabar offers expansive residences with uninterrupted views of the Arabian Sea and surrounding greenery, creating a level of exclusivity that is increasingly rare in South Mumbai\n\n## Lodha Malabar Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Lodha Malabar.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 BHK Apartment  3843 Sq. Ft. | **Price on Request** | Get Payment Plan |\n| 4 BHK Apartment  4643 Sq. Ft. | **Price on Request** | Get Payment Plan |\n| 5 BHK Apartment  6271 Sq. Ft. | **Price on Request** | Get Payment Plan |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nLodha Malabar's average asking price is cooling quarter-on-quarter, compared with Malabar Hill.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Lodha Malabar | Malabar Hill |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 79200 | 80650 |\n| Mar 2026 | 129550 | 95700 |\n| Dec 2025 | 129500 | 92350 |\n| Sep 2025 | 100850 | 76750 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nLodha Malabar avg. price is ₹ 79.2 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Malabar Hill at ₹ 80.7 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Kalpataru Azuro](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-azuro/175958/project \"Kalpataru Azuro\") | ₹ 1.56 L |\n| [Birla Anayu](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/birla-anayu/311961/project \"Birla Anayu\") | ₹ 1.21 L |\n| [Godrej Carmichael](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/godrej-carmichael/239033/project \"Godrej Carmichael\") | ₹ 86,050 |\n| Malabar Hill | ₹ 80,650 |\n| Current Project **Lodha Malabar** | ₹ 79,200 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Malabar Hill ranges from ₹ 97.1 K to ₹ 4.9 L with options available for 1,2,3,4 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Lodha Malabar | In Malabar Hill |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 97.1 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 2 L |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 3.8 L |\n| 4 BHK | - | ₹ 4.9 L |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Lodha Malabar.\n\nA total of 2 residential transactions has been registered so far for Lodha Malabar, amounting to ₹ 98 Cr till September 2026.\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for Lodha Malabar moved from ₹ 129,500/sqft to ₹ 129,550/sqft, reflecting a 0.04% rise.\n\nStructural Works reach 65% completion, Internal finishing stands at 5%.\n\nStructural Works reach 65% completion, Internal finishing stands at 6%.\n\nDuring Q4'2025, average property prices for Lodha Malabar moved from ₹ 100,850/sqft to ₹ 129,500/sqft, reflecting a 28.41% rise.\n\nStructural Works reach 58% completion, Internal finishing stands at 3%.\n\nA total of 2 out of 61 launched units have been booked as of December 2025, including 40% of 2 BHK(2 out of 5 units).\n\nStructural Works reach 51% completion.\n\nStructural Works reach 50% completion.\n\nStructural Works reach 48% completion.\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n2 Sales Transactions Registered in Lodha Malabar From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 1.1 L/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 | ₹ 98 Cr | ₹ 1.14 L / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## Lodha Malabar Floor Plans\n\nThe residences at Lodha Malabar have been planned to offer exceptional privacy, generous proportions, and uninterrupted views of the Arabian Sea and the Hanging Gardens. Rather than following repetitive layouts, every residence has been individually designed to maximise natural light, ventilation, and panoramic vistas. Floor-to-ceiling glazing, expansive living spaces, and thoughtfully positioned outdoor decks create homes that seamlessly connect with their surroundings.\n\n### Lodha Malabar Apartment Configurations\n\nUnit sizes from 3843 Sq.Ft. to 6271 Sq.Ft.\n\nHomes available in 4, 5 BHK configurations\n\n### Key Highlights of Lodha Malabar Floor Plans\n\nEvery residence at Lodha Malabar has been designed to deliver a private and refined living experience, where spacious interiors complement one of South Mumbai's most prestigious locations.\n\n#### Individually Designed Residences\n\nUnlike conventional developments with repetitive apartment layouts, each residence has been planned independently, giving every home a distinct character while making optimum use of space and natural surroundings.\n\n#### Expansive Living & Entertainment Areas\n\nThe floor plans feature large living and dining spaces that comfortably accommodate family life as well as formal entertaining. Open layouts create a seamless transition between different areas of the home while maintaining privacy for personal spaces.\n\n#### Floor-to-Ceiling Glazing\n\nLarge glass panels extend from floor to ceiling, allowing abundant daylight into the residences while framing uninterrupted views of the Arabian Sea, Hanging Gardens, and the South Mumbai skyline.\n\n#### Spacious Private Decks\n\nEach residence incorporates generous outdoor decks that function as an extension of the living space, providing residents with private areas to relax while enjoying panoramic sea and garden views.\n\n#### Privacy-Oriented Planning\n\nThe residences have been planned to offer a high degree of exclusivity through spacious layouts, carefully positioned living areas, and efficient circulation, ensuring a peaceful residential environment that reflects the project's luxury positioning.\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 4 BHK 3843 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Lodha Malabar, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:Price on Request\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 4 BHK 4643 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Lodha Malabar, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:Price on Request\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 5 BHK 6271 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Lodha Malabar, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:Price on Request\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of Lodha Malabar\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of Lodha Malabar to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\n![Lodha Malabar Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lodha-malabar-project-amenities-features1-4819.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Lodha Malabar Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lodha-malabar-project-amenities-features4-6188.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Lodha Malabar Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-malabar-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\nDownload brochure & master plan of Lodha Malabar to explore floor plans and layout details in Malabar Hill, Mumbai.\n\n### Project Brochure\n\nComplete details about the Project\n\n### Master Plan\n\nOverall project layout & design\n\n### Walkthrough Video\n\nVirtual tour of the property\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Lodha Malabar\n\nLuxury at Lodha Malabar extends beyond the residences into a carefully curated collection of lifestyle experiences. Rather than offering a conventional clubhouse, the development introduces Club Saint Amand, an exclusive private members' club where hospitality, wellness, leisure, and social experiences come together in an intimate setting. Complementing this is a dedicated hospitality team that delivers personalized services inspired by the standards of leading luxury hotels.\n\n### Wellness & Recreation\n\n* Gymnasium, Swimming Pool, Power Backup, Treated Water Supply, 24 x 7 Security, CCTV / Video Surveillance, Party Hall, Clubhouse, Rain Water Harvesting, Sewage Treatment Plant\n* Private Wellness Facilities\n* Leisure Spaces\n* Relaxation Zones\n\n### Club Saint Amand\n\n* Exclusive Private Members' Club\n* Social Lounge\n* Curated Leisure Experiences\n* Lifestyle Spaces Designed for Residents\n\n### Hospitality Services\n\n* Dedicated In-House Hospitality Team\n* Five-Star Inspired Lifestyle Management\n* Concierge-Style Assistance\n\n### Landscaped Outdoor Spaces\n\n* Sea-Facing Open Areas\n* Landscaped Green Spaces\n* Garden Retreats\n* Outdoor Relaxation Areas\n\n### Premium Lifestyle Features\n\n* Art Deco-Inspired Architecture\n* Grand Entrance Experience\n* Panoramic Sea & Garden Views\n* Exclusive Residential Environment\n\nLuxury at Lodha Malabar extends beyond the residences into a carefully curated collection of lifestyle experiences. Rather than offering a conventional clubhouse, the development introduces Club Saint Amand, an exclusive private members' club where hospitality, wellness, leisure, and social experiences come together in an intimate setting. Complementing this is a dedicated hospitality team that delivers personalized services inspired by the standards of leading luxury hotels.\n\n### Wellness & Recreation\n\nGymnasium, Swimming Pool, Power Backup, Treated Water Supply, 24 x 7 Security, CCTV / Video Surveillance, Party Hall, Clubhouse, Rain Water Harvesting, Sewage Treatment Plant\n\nPrivate Wellness Facilities\n\nLeisure Spaces\n\nRelaxation Zones\n\n### Club Saint Amand\n\nExclusive Private Members' Club\n\nSocial Lounge\n\nCurated Leisure Experiences\n\nLifestyle Spaces Designed for Residents\n\n### Hospitality Services\n\nDedicated In-House Hospitality Team\n\nFive-Star Inspired Lifestyle Management\n\nConcierge-Style Assistance\n\n### Landscaped Outdoor Spaces\n\nSea-Facing Open Areas\n\nLandscaped Green Spaces\n\nGarden Retreats\n\nOutdoor Relaxation Areas\n\n### Premium Lifestyle Features\n\nArt Deco-Inspired Architecture\n\nGrand Entrance Experience\n\nPanoramic Sea & Garden Views\n\nExclusive Residential Environment\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-gymnasiu-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Leisure Leisure\n\n![Leisure](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/leisure/am-ico-partyhal-active.svg)\n\n### Environment Environment\n\n![Environment](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/environment/am-ico-rainwate-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around Lodha Malabar Hill\n\nFew residential addresses in Mumbai enjoy the prestige associated with Malabar Hill. Positioned at Malabar Hill Mumbai, Lodha Malabar stands on the iconic Walkeshwar Road, opposite the Governor's Estate, with uninterrupted views of both the Arabian Sea and the Hanging Gardens. The location places residents at the center of South Mumbai while preserving the exclusivity, tranquillity, and heritage that define this historic neighborhood. Its location also offers seamless access to Gopi Birla Memorial School, Malabar Hill, Wilson College, Kamathipura, Walkeshwar Temple, Malabar Hill, allowing residents to remain connected to business districts, educational institutions, healthcare facilities, and cultural destinations across South Mumbai.\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| **Landmark** | **Distance / Connectivity** |\n| Hanging Gardens | 2.6 KM |\n| Governor's Estate | 1.9 KM |\n| Shree Babulnath Mandir | 1.4 KM |\n| Marine Drive | 0.5 KM |\n| Nariman Point | 5.4 KM |\n| CSMT Railway Station | 4.4 KM |\n\nConnectivity is based on the official project information and location context.\n\n### A Prestigious South Mumbai Address\n\nMalabar Hill has long been recognized as one of Mumbai's most distinguished residential neighborhoods. Its combination of heritage, greenery, sea frontage, and limited residential supply has made it one of the city's most sought-after luxury destinations. Lodha Malabar further strengthens this legacy by occupying one of the largest residential land parcels in the locality.\n\n### Excellent Connectivity\n\nDespite its private setting, the project offers convenient access to Nariman Point, Marine Drive, Churchgate, Cuffe Parade, and other important commercial districts, allowing residents to travel easily while remaining insulated from the city's everyday bustle.\n\n### Social Infrastructure Nearby\n\nLeading educational institutions, premium healthcare facilities, luxury hotels, fine dining destinations, and cultural landmarks are located within easy reach of the project, complementing the lifestyle associated with Malabar Hill.\n\n### An Address Built on Lasting Value\n\nOpportunities to own a residence in Malabar Hill remain exceptionally limited due to the scarcity of developable land. Combined with its sea-facing location, heritage surroundings, and premium residential character, Lodha Malabar represents an address that continues to hold long-term value for discerning homebuyers.\n\nFew residential addresses in Mumbai enjoy the prestige associated with Malabar Hill. Positioned at Malabar Hill Mumbai, Lodha Malabar stands on the iconic Walkeshwar Road, opposite the Governor's Estate, with uninterrupted views of both the Arabian Sea and the Hanging Gardens. The location places residents at the center of South Mumbai while preserving the exclusivity, tranquillity, and heritage that define this historic neighborhood. Its location also offers seamless access to Gopi Birla Memorial School, Malabar Hill, Wilson College, Kamathipura, Walkeshwar Temple, Malabar Hill, allowing residents to remain connected to business districts, educational institutions, healthcare facilities, and cultural destinations across South Mumbai.\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| **Landmark** | **Distance / Connectivity** |\n| Hanging Gardens | 2.6 KM |\n| Governor's Estate | 1.9 KM |\n| Shree Babulnath Mandir | 1.4 KM |\n| Marine Drive | 0.5 KM |\n| Nariman Point | 5.4 KM |\n| CSMT Railway Station | 4.4 KM |\n\n**Landmark**\n\n**Distance / Connectivity**\n\nHanging Gardens\n\n2.6 KM\n\nGovernor's Estate\n\n1.9 KM\n\nShree Babulnath Mandir\n\n1.4 KM\n\nMarine Drive\n\n0.5 KM\n\nNariman Point\n\n5.4 KM\n\nCSMT Railway Station\n\n4.4 KM\n\nConnectivity is based on the official project information and location context.\n\n### A Prestigious South Mumbai Address\n\nMalabar Hill has long been recognized as one of Mumbai's most distinguished residential neighborhoods. Its combination of heritage, greenery, sea frontage, and limited residential supply has made it one of the city's most sought-after luxury destinations. Lodha Malabar further strengthens this legacy by occupying one of the largest residential land parcels in the locality.\n\n### Excellent Connectivity\n\nDespite its private setting, the project offers convenient access to Nariman Point, Marine Drive, Churchgate, Cuffe Parade, and other important commercial districts, allowing residents to travel easily while remaining insulated from the city's everyday bustle.\n\n### Social Infrastructure Nearby\n\nLeading educational institutions, premium healthcare facilities, luxury hotels, fine dining destinations, and cultural landmarks are located within easy reach of the project, complementing the lifestyle associated with Malabar Hill.\n\n### An Address Built on Lasting Value\n\nOpportunities to own a residence in Malabar Hill remain exceptionally limited due to the scarcity of developable land. Combined with its sea-facing location, heritage surroundings, and premium residential character, Lodha Malabar represents an address that continues to hold long-term value for discerning homebuyers.\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai South](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-714;h-317;crop;)\n\nEstimate commute from your office or kid's school to Lodha Malabar.\n\n![Car travel mode](/assets/images/car-fill.svg)\n![Lodha Malabar](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lodha-malabar-project-project-large-image1-3945.jpg?aio=w-112;h-96;crop;)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Gopi Birla Memorial School\n\n#### White House\n\n#### Desa Hospital\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Malabar Hill\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\n![Locality rank](/assets/images/key-insights-icon/locality-rank.svg)\n\nBased on demand, livability, and activity\n\nMalabar Hill remains one of the peaceful and scenic localities in Mumbai. The abundance of lush green spaces like Hanging Gardens and Kamala Nehru Park, combined with stunning views of the Arabian Sea, offers a serene escape from the city's fast pace. The roads are well-maintained, street lighting is good, and the neighborhood feels safe even late at night. Access to top-tier schools, premier healthcare facilities, and South Mumbai's key business hubs makes living here incredibly convenient and comfortable.\n\n— SOURABH, Owner\n\n## RERA Details of Lodha Malabar\n\nLodha Malabar is registered under the Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority (MahaRERA) with registration number P51900034949, P51900055626 The registration enables prospective buyers to verify official project information before proceeding with a purchase.\n\nThe MahaRERA registration provides access to important project-related information, including:\n\n* Approved project plans\n* Construction progress\n* Possession timeline\n* Statutory approvals\n* Developer disclosures\n* Regulatory compliance\n\nReviewing these records allows buyers to independently verify project details while ensuring greater transparency throughout the home-buying process.\n\nLodha Malabar is registered under the Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority (MahaRERA) with registration number P51900034949, P51900055626 The registration enables prospective buyers to verify official project information before proceeding with a purchase.\n\nThe MahaRERA registration provides access to important project-related information, including:\n\nApproved project plans\n\nConstruction progress\n\nPossession timeline\n\nStatutory approvals\n\nDeveloper disclosures\n\nRegulatory compliance\n\nReviewing these records allows buyers to independently verify project details while ensuring greater transparency throughout the home-buying process.\n\n## Property Registration Data\n\n2 Sales Transactions Registered in Lodha Malabar From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 1.1 L/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Registry Date | Floor/Unit | Tower/Wing | Area | Transaction Value | Rate/Sq. Ft. | Actions |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2026-01-29 | Floor 8, Unit 801 | Palaces, B | 4,456 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-10-24 | Floor 6, Unit 601 | B | 4,456 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-09-30 | Floor 7, Unit 701 | B | 4,456 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n\n## How does Lodha Malabar compare with similar projects?\n\n![Lodha Malabar project in Malabar Hill, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-malabar-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Lodha Malabar](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/lodha-malabar/208302/project \"Lodha Malabar\")\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![DB Realty Orchid Heights project in Mahalaxmi, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-db-realty-orchid-heights-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [DB Realty Orchid Heights](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/db-realty-orchid-heights/2844/project \"DB Realty Orchid Heights\")\n\nMahalaxmi, Mumbai\n\n![Raheja Excelsior project in Tardeo, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-raheja-excelsior-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Raheja Excelsior](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/raheja-excelsior/3061/project \"Raheja Excelsior\")\n\nTardeo, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## Lodha Malabar Reviews & Ratings\n\nRead the reviews about Lodha Malabar located at Malabar Hill Mumbai and see what residents and real estate experts have to say about the project.\n\nReal estate agent\n\nThis project stands out for its prime location and quality construction. Clients appreciate the modern amenities.\n\nOwner\n\nLodha Malabar stands as an architectural marvel with an oceanic panorama, presenting residents with an unparalleled view of the sea. The project's design philosophy reflects a perfect fusion of aesthetics and functionality, providing residents with a sophisticated living experience. Beyond the intricately designed residences, expansive windows and balconies capture the vastness of the ocean, creating an atmosphere of grandeur. Lodha Malabar is not merely a living space; it's a masterpiece that transcends trends, offering residents an enduring symbol of coastal elegance.\n\nOwner\n\nLodha Malabar is a coastal green oasis seamlessly integrated with urban vibrancy. The project incorporates eco-friendly practices and sustainable design elements, creating a residence where residents can live in harmony with both nature and the city. Lush green spaces and environmentally conscious features reflect Lodha Malabar's commitment to creating a sustainable and healthy living environment. It is an ideal choice for those who appreciate the serenity of coastal living within the dynamic urban landscape.\n\nOwner\n\nLodha Malabar redefines connectivity and seaside serenity, placing residents at the heart of coastal vibrancy. Strategically located, the project ensures seamless access to key destinations, including business districts, educational institutions, and entertainment hubs. The convenience of modern living is elevated, making Lodha Malabar a coveted address for those who seek a lifestyle seamlessly integrated with the rhythmic charm of the sea. It's not merely a residence; it's a gateway to a life where connectivity and coastal serenity converge for a well-rounded seaside living experience.\n\nOwner\n\nLodha Malabar celebrates cultural harmony by the coastal breeze, creating a living environment that resonates with residents from diverse cultural backgrounds. The residences showcase a blend of design elements inspired by coastal aesthetics, fostering an inclusive community. Communal spaces become hubs for cultural exchange, contributing to a vibrant tapestry of experiences within the community. Lodha Malabar is not just a coastal residence; it's a microcosm of cultural richness, where every resident adds to the harmonious blend of coastal living.\n\nOwner\n\nLodha Malabar exemplifies a sustainable coastal retreat, setting a new standard for responsible coastal development. The project incorporates eco-friendly practices, energy-efficient systems, and green initiatives, reflecting a commitment to environmental responsibility. Residents enjoy luxurious coastal living while actively contributing to a greener future. Lodha Malabar is a symbol of conscientious coastal living, where sustainability and luxury coalesce seamlessly, providing residents with a coastal residence that aligns with their values for a greener lifestyle.\n\nOwner\n\nI love my flat. The gym is top-notch, and the connectivity makes commuting easy.\n\nOwner\n\nOur family loves the spacious apartments and the peaceful environment. It's a great place to raise kids.\n\nOwner\n\nLodha Malabar epitomizes coastal elegance and modern luxury, offering residents a unique living experience by the sea. The project's architectural design seamlessly integrates with the coastal surroundings, providing breathtaking views and a sense of tranquility. Each residence becomes a private sanctuary, capturing the essence of coastal living while maintaining the highest standards of modern luxury. Lodha Malabar is not just a residence; it's a coastal retreat where residents can indulge in the beauty of the sea without compromising on urban comfort.\n\nOwner\n\nLodha Malabar excels as a seaside haven, featuring family-centric spaces designed for modern coastal living. Spacious interiors provide ample room for family gatherings and activities, fostering a sense of togetherness. With dedicated areas for relaxation and communal spaces, the project creates an environment where families can thrive amidst the soothing backdrop of the sea. Lodha Malabar is more than just a residence; it is a carefully crafted space that transforms living into an enriching experience for every family member.\n\nOwner\n\nLodha Malabar introduces coastal tranquility combined with tech-savvy comfort, offering residents a modern living experience by the sea. The project seamlessly integrates smart home features and cutting-edge technology, providing residents with convenience and control at their fingertips. Lodha Malabar is not just a coastal residence; it's a futuristic haven where residents can enjoy the serenity of the sea while embracing the conveniences of a technologically advanced lifestyle.\n\nOwner\n\nLodha Malabar prioritizes wellness-centric coastal living, offering residents a holistic environment where the sea and well-being coexist. State-of-the-art fitness facilities, yoga spaces, and serene landscaped areas contribute to an atmosphere of calm and rejuvenation. The project is not merely about coastal luxury; it's an invitation to embrace a lifestyle that seamlessly integrates modern comfort with a focus on holistic wellness. Lodha Malabar is a haven for those who seek a coastal residence that caters to their overall well-being.\n\nOwner\n\nLodha Malabar redefines connectivity while offering oceanic opulence, placing residents at the forefront of coastal vibrancy. The strategic location ensures seamless access to urban amenities, business districts, and cultural centers, all with the breathtaking backdrop of the ocean. The convenience of modern coastal living is elevated, making Lodha Malabar a sought-after address for those who seek a lifestyle seamlessly integrated with the rhythmic charm of the sea. It's not just a coastal residence; it's a gateway to a life where connectivity and coastal opulence converge for a well-rounded seaside living experience.\n\nOwner\n\nWhile the area is nice, I was hoping for greater returns on my investment. The appreciation hasn't lived up to my expectations.\n\nTenant\n\nThe facilities are wonderful, but I feel maintenance can be better.\n\n## Lodha Track Record\n\n![Lodha logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/lodha-521-6366.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\nMr Mangal Prabhat Lodha started the Lodha Group in 1980. This 42-year-old corporation has constructed 85 million square feet, done INR 50,000Cr+ business, and delivered 50,000+ residences between 2016 and 2022. They have real estate in London, Pune, Mumbai, and Hyderabad. They are accomplishing their purpose of Building a Better Life for all of their clients as a real estate firm.\nSome of the best-featured products of Lodha Group are  Lodha Bellevue, Lodha Splendora, Amara, Codename Central, and Lodha Belmondo. And other top-notch ongoing projects are No 1 Grosvenor Square, Lodha Maison, World One, Lodha Ciel, World View, The World Towers, Lodha Park - Trump Tower Mumbai, Lodha Park - Marquise, Lodha Evoq, New Cuffe Parade, Lodha Park, Lodha Primo, Lodha Aura, New Cuffe Parade, etc. \nCurrently, there are 40 and more ongoing projects under the Lodha group, whereas 30 and more projects are going to be launched very soon. Their mission of building a better future and creating leaders for tomorrow goes hand-in-hand. Their amazing work has been rewarded with several certificates and awards worldwide during the time-period of 2014 to 2022.\n\n![Lodha Aureus residential project in Sewri](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-aureus-project-flagship-opt-b1aedb56-f1d6-486e-8260-653863e822cc.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nSewri, Mumbai\n\n3, 4 BHK Apartment, Retail Shop\n\n₹ 4.60 Cr to 10.70 Cr\n\n![Lodha Elaris residential project in Vikhroli West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-elaris-project-flagship-opt-a6f5ff23-11cd-42f5-bb1a-134e90c6e093.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nVikhroli West, Mumbai\n\n4 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 9.00 Cr\n\n![Lodha Worli residential project in Worli](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-worli-project-flagship-opt-bc0b8b13-1b11-4d39-b3eb-487a1ad88d79.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n2, 3, 4 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Lodha Sovrano residential project in Jogeshwari West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-sovrano-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nJogeshwari West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 2.99 Cr to 3.63 Cr\n\n![Lodha Corinthia residential project in Bhandup West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-corinthia-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBhandup West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 2.35 Cr to 3.20 Cr\n\n![Lodha Vikhroli residential project in Vikhroli West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-vikhroli-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nVikhroli West, Mumbai\n\n2 BHK Apartment, Office Space\n\n₹ 1.93 Cr to 2.89 Cr\n\n![Lodha Riservo residential project in Vikhroli West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-riservo-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nVikhroli West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 3.65 Cr to 5.08 Cr\n\n![Lodha Altus residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-altus-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n3, 4 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 4.44 Cr to 7.00 Cr\n\n![Lodha Sea Face residential project in Worli](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-sea-face-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n5, 6 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Re